  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Microfinance System Strengthening and Consolidation Program Argentina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento y Consolidacin del Sistema Nacional de Microfinanza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la operacin sera contribuir a facilitar el acceso al microcrdito a segmentos de la poblacin de menores ingresos. El objetivo especfico sera fortalecer la capacidad institucional de la red de instituciones microfinancieras (IMF).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the operation would be to contribute to facilitate access to microcredit to lower income segments of the population. The specific objective would be to strengthen the institutional capacity of the network of microfinance institutions (MFIs).</narrative>
  </description>
